</text><text class="terminal-3002022491-r5" x="0" y="68.8" textLength="719.8" clip-path="url(#terminal-3002022491-line-2)">&#160;&#160;Your&#160;raw&#160;words&#160;are&#160;preserved&#160;as-is;&#160;nothing&#160;is&#160;rewritten.</text><text class="terminal-3002022491-r1" x="976" y="68.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3002022491-line-2)">
